Source: multilang
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Raúl Mahiques <claude.ia@raulmahiques.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               pkg-config,
               libsqlite3-dev,
               libpq-dev,
               default-libmysqlclient-dev,
               libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libmultilang0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Reusable multi-language string storage library (runtime)
 Provides ml_retrieve_data, ml_insert_data, and ml_connect (plus a C++
 wrapper, libmultilangxx) for storing and retrieving translated strings,
 keyed by string_id + BCP 47 language_id, against SQLite, PostgreSQL, or
 MySQL/MariaDB.
 .
 Runtime shared libraries only -- ${shlibs:Depends} (computed by
 dpkg-shlibdeps from this build's own linked .so files) pulls in
 whichever libpq/libsqlite3/libssl/libmariadb runtime packages this
 build actually needs, rather than this control file guessing package
 names that can differ across Debian/Ubuntu releases. See
 libmultilang-dev for headers.

Package: libmultilang-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmultilang0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Reusable multi-language string storage library (headers)
 Development headers (multilang.h, multilang.hpp) and unversioned .so
 symlinks for linking against libmultilang0.
